  "name": "ProactiveVA: Proactive Visual Analytics with LLM-Based UI Agent",
  "notes": "Adjacent work on embedded assistance in two instrumented visual-analytics systems. Its in-lab user-study evidence is context-specific, and the paper discusses clarification and intervention-control trade-offs. General GUI-agent performance is not inferred. Basis: complete retained abstract and source-reviewed sections of the exact-version paper (5.3 User study; 5.3.2 Observed issues; 6.1 Design trade-off; 6.2 Limitations); not an entire-paper reading or reproduction claim.",
  "published_at": "2025-07-24",
